# The working tree on Windows had CRLF endings while the blob in git is LF, and the
# host tests slice firmware source by looking for a "\n}\n" function end - a marker
# CRLF never matches, which silently widened a per-function check to the whole
# sketch. Normalise on checkout so the tree and the blob agree everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries and images must not be touched.
*.bin  binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz   binary
